{"book":"psalms","num":59,"verses":[{"en":"Deliver me from mine enemies, O my God: defend me from them that rise up against me.","n":1,"sm":"Atua e, ia e laveai mai ia te au i e ua ita mai ia te au; ia e faamamalu mai ia te au i e ua laga mai ia te au.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"laveai"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ita"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au;"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faamamalu"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"laga"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au."}]},{"en":"Deliver me from the workers of iniquity, and save me from bloody men.","n":2,"sm":"Ta e l","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ta"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"l"}]},{"en":"For, lo, they lie in wait for my soul: the mighty are gathered against me; not for my transgression, nor for my sin, O LORD.","n":3,"sm":"aveai mai","w":[{"en":"","sm":"aveai"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"}]},{"en":"They run and prepare themselves without my fault: awake to help me, and behold.","n":4,"sm":"ia te a","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"a"}]},{"en":"Thou therefore, O LORD God of hosts, the God of Israel, awake to visit all the heathen: be not merciful to any wicked transgressors. Selah.","n":5,"sm":"u i e ua fai","w":[{"en":"","sm":"u"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"}]},{"en":"They return at evening: they make a noise like a dog, and go round about the city.","n":6,"sm":"amio leaga;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"amio"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga;"}]},{"en":"Behold, they belch out with their mouth: swords are in their lips: for who, say they, doth hear?","n":7,"sm":"ia","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ia"}]},{"en":"But thou, O LORD, shalt laugh at them; thou shalt have all the heathen in derision.","n":8,"sm":"e faao","w":[{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faao"}]},{"en":"Because of his strength will I wait upon thee: for God is my defence.","n":9,"sm":"la mai","w":[{"en":"","sm":"la"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"}]},{"en":"The God of my mercy shall prevent me: God shall let me see my desire upon mine enemies.","n":10,"sm":"ia te a","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"a"}]},{"en":"Slay them not, lest my people forget: scatter them by thy power; and bring them down, O Lord our shield.","n":11,"sm":"u i tagat","w":[{"en":"","sm":"u"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"tagat"}]},{"en":"For the sin of their mouth and the words of their lips let them even be taken in their pride: and for cursing and lying which they speak.","n":12,"sm":"a ua totolima.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"totolima."}]},{"en":"Consume them in wrath, consume them, that they may not be: and let them know that God ruleth in Jacob unto the ends of the earth. Selah.","n":13,"sm":"II 12 13","w":[{"en":"","sm":"II"},{"en":"","sm":"12"},{"en":"","sm":"13"}]},{"en":"And at evening let them return; and let them make a noise like a dog, and go round about the city.","n":14,"sm":"IS SALAMO Aua faauta mai, ua latou lamalama e fasioti ia te au; ua faapotopoto ē malolosi ia agaleaga mai ia te au; le ALII e, e le ona o loʻu solitulafono, po o sa‘u agasala. Ua leai sa‘u pagota, a ua latou taufetuli mai, ma latou sauniuni. Ia e tulai mai e faafetaiai mai ia te au, ma e silasila mai. O oe foi, le ALII e, le Atua o “au, le Atua o Isaraelu, ia e malcifua mai, ma e asiasi ai i nuu ese uma lava; aua ne“i e alofa atu i se tasi o e amio leaga ma le pepelo.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"IS"},{"en":"","sm":"SALAMO"},{"en":"","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"","sm":"faauta"},{"en":"","sm":"mai,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","s